    "updated_at": "2022-07-04T22:14:08Z",
    "body": "The events aren't really buffered, but the API updates its state and fires events in tasks, so it happens when the event loop gets to such a task (this allows you to register listeners in the same script even if the network connection were immediate).\r\n\r\nhttps://websockets.spec.whatwg.org/#feedback-from-the-protocol",
